   "text": "Every boiler tune-up comes with a safety check. We examine your operating pressure and/or temperature controls, fuel safety shut-off valves, flame safeguard control and level controls (if applicable), for accurate settings to protect your equipment and ensure safe operating conditions. We will test fire the unit at operating temperature or pressure, allowing the unit to cycle on and off. We will set combustion and check for normal operation of all safety devices."
